        {
          "id": "bench_084",
          "unit_id": "pilot::bench_084",
          "category": "multiline",
          "source_text": "ここからは、日々を自分で組み立てる。\nゴールは下段の『物語を進める』——カードに出ている条件（陥落度など）を満たせば、物語の続きが始まる。\nそのために、昼に稼ぎ、夜に堕とす。",
          "raw_machine_text": "From here, assemble your own day.\nThe goal is to meet the conditions on the card (e.g., degradation).\nFor that reason, earn at lunch and fall at night.",
          "raw_machine_error": null,
          "final_reviewed_text": "From here on, you organize each day yourself.\nThe goal is 'Advance Story' at the bottom—satisfying card conditions (such as corruption) begins the next part of the story.\nTo that end, earn by day and corrupt by night.",
          "review_status": "approved",
          "human_action": "manually_corrected",
          "reviewer_notes": "Corrected awkward phrasing ('earn at lunch and fall at night') and restored 3-line multiline layout."
        },
        {
          "id": "bench_086",
          "unit_id": "pilot::bench_086",
          "category": "multiline",
          "source_text": "【夜の本命】彼女たちのカードから催眠をかけ、陥落度を上げる。\n堕とすほど深い暗示・Hイベント・物語が解禁されていく。\nカードの顔と状態は、堕ちるほど変わっていく。",
          "raw_machine_text": "[Current life] Hypnosis is applied from the cards of hers, increasing the degree of fall.\nA deeper memorandum, H events, and stories are denied.\nThe face and state of the card will change.",
          "raw_machine_error": null,
          "final_reviewed_text": "[[Night Target]] Use hypnosis via their cards to increase corruption.\nThe deeper they fall, the more deep suggestions, events, and story chapters unlock.\nTheir card portraits and statuses evolve as they fall deeper.",
          "review_status": "approved",
          "human_action": "manually_corrected",
          "reviewer_notes": "Escaped Ren'Py interpolation brackets ([[]]) to prevent variable lookup syntax crashes, corrected meaning, preserved 3 lines."
        },
        {
          "id": "bench_090",
          "unit_id": "pilot::bench_090",
          "category": "multiline",
          "source_text": "いまの尖った声は【抵抗】の印だ。抵抗に撃った暗示は通らない。\nそれどころか【覚醒リスク】——正気に戻られる危険——が跳ね上がる。\n100に達すれば覚醒され、その夜は強制終了。積み上げた成果も削られる。\n——撃つな。こういう時は『見つめる』で心を揺さぶり、隙を作れ。",
          "raw_machine_text": "This is the mark of resistance. There is no implications shot on the resistance.\n[A。ning Risks]—H。ds that can be returned positively——there is a bounce.\nA。ned when reaching 100, the night is forced to 。. You can sharpen the results of stacking.\nDutch In such a case, shake your mind and make a gap with \"seeing\".",
          "raw_machine_error": null,
          "final_reviewed_text": "That sharp voice is the sign of [[Resistance]]. Suggestions fired into resistance will not take.\nWhat's worse, [[Awakening Risk]]—the danger of her returning to her senses—surges.\nReaching 100 triggers awakening, abruptly ending the night and chipping away accumulated progress.\n—Do not suggest. In times like this, shake her heart by 'Staring' and create an opening.",
